## What I'd do differently

I'd probably add more features and refine and optimise my games. I would also make the website more aesthetic and stuff because rn its pretty ugly. I feel like all the games on this site have so much potential I just didnt have enough time to develop them into something which is truly cool. FOr example, I could probably make the pokemon Akinator way, way better than what it is right now as it only has some ultra-popular pokemon. I'll probably continue development of this in another ysws.

